[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4321.27, "timestamp": "01:12:01", "text": "那么对于旅行者来说呢？难道不是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4345.35, "timestamp": "01:12:25", "text": "好吧，我选远行者，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4347.669, "timestamp": "01:12:27", "text": "我即将来到这个世界。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4349.189, "timestamp": "01:12:29", "text": "好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4349.99, "timestamp": "01:12:29", "text": "自由的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4353.03, "timestamp": "01:12:33", "text": "你好。我将选择"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4354.229, "timestamp": "01:12:34", "text": "进口，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4356.39, "timestamp": "01:12:36", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4358.87, "timestamp": "01:12:38", "text": "点击“是”即可。好的，你还有另一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4362.149, "timestamp": "01:12:42", "text": "语言能力。所以，是的，如果如果如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4364.39, "timestamp": "01:12:44", "text": "如果它有复选框，那就意味着它有复选框。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4366.79, "timestamp": "01:12:46", "text": "你已经拥有了。所以，呃，尽量不要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4369.27, "timestamp": "01:12:49", "text": "选那个，因为它……嗯，它会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4373.1, "timestamp": "01:12:53", "text": "这将会被浪费掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4375.59, "timestamp": "01:12:55", "text": "[音乐]"}]